/-!
# KIL2: generating the offset table of a controlled shift

`genP Q ac` pushes onto stack `14` the table `tbl Q ac` of the offsets
`(Σ_k c_k · d_k) mod Q`, `p = (d_0, …, d_{r-1})` ranging over the mixed-radix shape
